  "details": "The curl packages provide the libcurl library and the curl utility for downloading files from servers using various protocols, including HTTP, FTP, and LDAP.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * curl: curl: Cookie injection via malicious HTTP server using super cookies (CVE-2026-8924)\n  * curl: curl: Information disclosure via incorrect Digest authentication header reuse (CVE-2026-11856)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
